      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "真好，比起和那些打手打交道，我还是更喜欢和人玩模拟生物对决。\n哦对了，重要的事情是——好了，这样你就有核心保护区的通行权了。",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "“鸭爵？”",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_enemy_2001_duckmi",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "“鸭爵？”",
            "content": "如果你在里面看到鬼鬼祟祟的人，记得要向我或者主办方报告，其他时间自由探索，注意安全就好。\n祝你探索顺利！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_enemy_2001_duckmi",
            "options": [
              {
                "content": "能说明一下这片区域的独特性吗？",
                "assignments": [
                  {
                    "type": "flag",
                    "data": {
                      "key": "n0_o0"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "iconId": "icon_option_talk"
              },
              {
                "content": "你能提供各类<color=#00ffff>道具</color>吗？",
                "assignments": [
                  {
                    "type": "flag",
                    "data": {
                      "key": "open_shop"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "iconId": "icon_option_interact"
              },
              {
                "content": "我想和你再对决一次",
                "assignments": [
                  {
                    "type": "flag",
                    "data": {
                      "key": "battle"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "iconId": "icon_option_talk"
              },
              {
                "content": "好的，我会注意的",
                "assignments": [
                  {
                    "type": "flag",
                    "data": {
                      "key": "n0_o3"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "iconId": "icon_option_talk"
              }
            ],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "condition": {
          "type": "exist",
          "data": {
            "Type": "exist",
            "key": "n0_o0"
          }
        },
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "“鸭爵？”",
            "content": "这里是汐斯塔奇生保护区的核心区域，里面可以说有着周边区域中最稀有的生物。\n也因为这些生物的价值，以前这里就招来了不少偷猎者，现在还有更大的势力在觊觎这片区域。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_enemy_2001_duckmi",
            "options": [
              {
                "content": "继续",
                "assignments": [
                  {
                    "type": "flag",
                    "data": {
                      "key": "n1_o0"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "iconId": "icon_option_talk"
              }
            ],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "condition": {
          "type": "exist",
          "data": {
            "Type": "exist",
            "key": "n1_o0"
          }
        },
